The Agency’s Bid Cover Letter (including eligibility, following Code of Integrity in Public

Procurement - CIPP);

 Power of attorney if any;

 Qualification Information with enclosures;

 Write up on Bidder’s Organisation, confirmation of compliance with (or deviations

from) Description of Services, Activity Schedule, Statutory Obligation and Facilities
to be provided by the Procuring Entity, Statutory and Contractual requirements,
Respective obligations of Procuring Entity and the Agency, Contract For, GCC and
SCC; etc. and

 Enclosures: Cost of Bid/Bid Processing Fee/Bid Securing Declaration Form.
